# Azure Role-Based Access Control (RBAC)

## Overview

In this project I demonstrated Azure Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) by reviewing role definitions, creating role assignments and configuring a custom role.

I reviewed subscription-level role assignments and built-in role permissions. I then configured role assignments at resource-group scope using the Reader and Virtual Machine Contributor built-in roles.

I also created a custom role named **VM Operator - Limited**, with permissions to read, start and restart virtual machines. The role does not grant permission to delete virtual machines or assign roles.

Finally, I assigned the custom role to Tinashe Sibanda at the `rg-rbac-lab` resource-group scope and verified the assignment in Azure.

---

